OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 27 years over child
OL,4,Arape in 1980s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 27 years
OL,7,Fafter being found guilty of raping a
OL,8,Fchild and sexually assaulting another
OL,9,Fteenage girl in Solihull during the
OL,10,F1980s.
OL,12,FPaul Aymes, 68, from Melrose Walk,
OL,13,FBasingstoke, was convicted of one count
OL,14,Fof rape and seven counts of sexual
OL,15,Fassault following a trial at Birmingham
OL,16,FCrown Court.
OL,18,FDet Con Andrew Jones, from West
OL,19,FMidlands Police's Major Crime Team,
OL,20,Fdescribed Aymes as a "sexual predator".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
